{"5007890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHAINSPIRE", "steam_appid": 5007890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/02eb10a1d773bd29950e2cb9132db487.avif?t=1788297497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras_big/02eb10a1d773bd29950e2cb9132db487.webp?t=1788297497 width=1560 height=274 /></span>CHAINSPIRE is a co-op soulslike platformer for 1-4 players in which the party is bound by a fully simulated physical chain. Combat, platforming and puzzles - all of it is built around that piece of iron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP AND THE CHAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend becomes your enemy the moment they stop listening to you. The chain here is the real thing: it catches on geometry, goes taut, and drags back whoever wasn't paying attention. The difficulty climbs steadily as you go, and the bigger the party, the harder it gets for everyone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character your own. Customize the colors of their clothing and armor, combining different shades to create a look that stands out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss is unique and comes with its own attacks. You learn each of them separately, and nobody gets one on the first run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI COMPANION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is optional. If you have no one to play with, or you'd rather make the climb alone, an AI companion takes the other end of the chain. It follows your route, fights alongside you and turns up where a second pair of hands is needed. Solo is a full mode, not a concession: the chain is still there, and so are all of its rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASS SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the class that suits you and your party: swordsman, archer, mage or special secret class. Each has its own strengths and weaknesses. Your job is to balance the party: on a single chain, what matters isn't only who you are, but who's holding the other end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DARK, BRUTAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way up starts in damp dungeons and runs through halls, galleries and bridges that show you exactly how far you've climbed and how long the fall would be. Nothing here lights your path: look around, climb where you probably shouldn't, and take everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW GAME+</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the main game and a new mode opens up, with the difficulty scaled several times over.<br><br><br>When creating this game, we drew inspiration from games such as Chained Together, the Dark Souls series and Elden Ring</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/02eb10a1d773bd29950e2cb9132db487.avif?t=1788297497\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras_big/02eb10a1d773bd29950e2cb9132db487.webp?t=1788297497 width=1560 height=274 /></span>CHAINSPIRE is a co-op soulslike platformer for 1-4 players in which the party is bound by a fully simulated physical chain. Combat, platforming and puzzles - all of it is built around that piece of iron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/df2526ee78fe48795f7da918376e8bb3.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP AND THE CHAIN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friend becomes your enemy the moment they stop listening to you. The chain here is the real thing: it catches on geometry, goes taut, and drags back whoever wasn't paying attention. The difficulty climbs steadily as you go, and the bigger the party, the harder it gets for everyone in it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/3d37e3add3ad76269424db571f8531e4.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION CHARACTER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your character your own. Customize the colors of their clothing and armor, combining different shades to create a look that stands out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/c17d0d3a9d808a1d5e6f258256ec9808.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss is unique and comes with its own attacks. You learn each of them separately, and nobody gets one on the first run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.poster.avif?t=1788297497\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.webm?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/extras/073bf2cfaed49409e8fb3911e30f2053.mp4?t=1788297497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI COMPANION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op is optional. If you have no one to play with, or you'd rather make the climb alone, an AI companion takes the other end of the chain. It follows your route, fights alongside you and turns up where a second pair of hands is needed. Solo is a full mode, not a concession: the chain is still there, and so are all of its rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASS SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the class that suits you and your party: swordsman, archer, mage or special secret class. Each has its own strengths and weaknesses. Your job is to balance the party: on a single chain, what matters isn't only who you are, but who's holding the other end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A DARK, BRUTAL WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way up starts in damp dungeons and runs through halls, galleries and bridges that show you exactly how far you've climbed and how long the fall would be. Nothing here lights your path: look around, climb where you probably shouldn't, and take everything you find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NEW GAME+</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish the main game and a new mode opens up, with the difficulty scaled several times over.<br><br><br>When creating this game, we drew inspiration from games such as Chained Together, the Dark Souls series and Elden Ring</p>", "short_description": "CHAINSPIRE is a soul-like platformer for 1–4 players connected by a real physical chain. Your friend will become your enemy the very moment they stop listening to you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/72b0828df4942a0192a7c107076abf2172c0fd73/header.jpg?t=1788297497", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/a3bca92166131499aa676de675a960b7ca6c5ede/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788297497", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5007890/a3bca92166131499aa676de675a960b7ca6c5ede/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788297497", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Pro